{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06618","headline":"奉别长史庾公太守徐公应召 · 储光羲","name":"奉别长史庾公太守徐公应召","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烈风起江汉，白浪忽如山。\n方伯骤勤王，杞人亦忧天。\n酆镐顷霾晦，云龙召我贤。\n车骑北艰苦，艅艎西泝沿。\n水灵静湍濑，猛兽趋後先。\n龙楼开新阳，万里出云间。\n宇宙既焜耀，崇德济巨川。\n受命在神宗，振兵犹轩辕。\n煌煌踰涿鹿，穆穆更坤元。\n明王朝太阶，远迩望嘉言。\n游子淡何思，江湖将永年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06618.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06618","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}